{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","剑威凌迫"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤大量的飞剑对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","召唤大量的飞剑持续对一名敌人进行攻击，造成9次30% ATK伤害，每次附带敌人当前生命值5% + 0.5%的额外伤害，额外伤害最高不超过自身150% + 10%的攻击力。优先选择当前生命值最高的敌人作为目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":53,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":74,"end":80,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能造成的伤害还会附带50点生命汲取。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至32% ATK，每次附带敌人当前生命值5.5% + 0.5%的额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至34% ATK，每次附带敌人当前生命值6% + 0.5%的额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至36% ATK，每次附带敌人当前生命值6.5% + 0.5%的额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","快意鞭打"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对扇形范围的敌人造成伤害，命中后若敌人生命百分比较低则额外追加一次伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","鞭打面前2格扇形范围的敌人，造成180% + 15% ATK伤害，若命中后敌人生命值百分比低于70%，则会立即追加一次鞭打，对面前2格扇形范围的敌人额外造成230% + 25% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":82,"end":88,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":78,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至185% + 15% ATK，追加鞭打的伤害提升至235% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至190% + 15% ATK，追加鞭打的伤害提升至240% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至200% + 15% ATK，追加鞭打的伤害提升至250% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","缚身囚魂"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名生命百分比较低的敌人造成大量伤害并使其无法行动。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用飞剑将一名生命值百分比低于70%的敌人囚禁，造成300% ATK伤害并使其被强制倒地无法行动，持续5 + 1.5秒。本技能对每名敌人最多触发一次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次成功囚禁一名敌人时，自身将永久吸收其8%的攻击力，每场战斗中自身通过这个方式吸收的攻击力最高不超过自身50%的攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次成功囚禁一名敌人时，自身将永久吸收其10%的攻击力，每场战斗中自身通过这个方式吸收的攻击力最高不超过自身50%的攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次成功囚禁一名敌人时，自身将永久吸收其12%的攻击力，每场战斗中自身通过这个方式吸收的攻击力最高不超过自身50%的攻击力。"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身受到的伤害降低。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低20%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","魂之沐浴"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始、囚禁敌人后，“快意鞭打”没有冷却时间，并且必定会追加一次鞭打。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始以及每次成功囚禁一名敌人时，自身沐浴灵魂的力量，释放下1次“快意鞭打”不会进入冷却时间，并且必定会追加一次鞭打。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“快意鞭打”附带敌人当前生命值5%的额外伤害，额外伤害最高不超过自身150%的攻击力，并且“快意鞭打”造成的伤害还会附带50点生命汲取。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","释放下2次“快意鞭打”不会进入冷却时间。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“快意鞭打”附带敌人当前生命值5.5%的额外伤害，额外伤害最高不超过自身160%的攻击力，并且“快意鞭打”造成的伤害还会附带52点生命汲取。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","囚禁敌人后，自身回复生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每次成功囚禁一名敌人时，自身回复150% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“缚身囚魂”伤害提升60%，每当一名曾被囚禁的敌人被击败后，斯莱泽享受这名敌人的灵魂，获得抵御值等同于该敌人100%最大生命值的护盾，抵御值最多不超过自身1500%的攻击力，持续15秒。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","蛰鳞"]]}